\newlabel{fig:heatmap}{{7}{6}{Mean expression of top conserved villus tip markers across all region-layer combinations. Columns are ordered Crypt $\rightarrow $ Bottom villous $\rightarrow $ Top villous within each region, reflecting the biological gradient. Mitochondrial genes excluded for clarity}{figure.caption.7}{}}
